WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
- We've been talking quite a bit about this water crisis

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.860
in Flint, Michigan.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.000
Outrageous water crisis that may actually

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.360
be criminal in nature.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.520
Lead in the water after the source for the town's water

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.420
was switched to the Flint River

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:17.680
has potentially poisoned up to 8,000 children.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.160
So I was thrilled to hear that the Michigan Senate

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.800
came together and they were able to push a bill through,

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.160
which does absolutely nothing about the water crisis

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.280
in Flint, but instead bans anal sex,

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.960
so-called sodomy ban.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.840
It it even more insane

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.120
because Michigan already has a sodomy ban

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.000
and obviously these bans are ridiculous

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.080
because the 2003 Supreme Court case

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.240
of Lawrence v. Texas declares

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.420
sodomy bans are unconstitutional in all states.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.120
So let me say this as concisely as possible, Louis.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.020
Instead of helping the people being poisoned

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.500
by their own water

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.340
as a result of a government decision

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.680
to save some money,

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.840
Michigan Republicans are spending time and money

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.540
to uphold a sodomy ban

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.660
that number one, already exists,

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.580
and number two, is impossible to enforce

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.080
and unconstitutional.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:10.140
What a great use of time from our friends,

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.580
the Republicans in Michigan, huh?

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:16.140
- I think the saddest part about this is

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:20.160
probably the majority of their constituents,

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.280
maybe not constituents,

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.920
maybe just their supporters,
-[David] Okay.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.800
- Probably have no idea that this is even happening.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.800
-[David] Maybe not.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:26.980
- And

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.600
I just don't understand

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.800
who gets up in the face of a water crisis like this

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.000
and says,

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.140
"This is important. We need to focus on this."

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:37.160
-[David] Let's ban anal. Yeah.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.240
- And I'm gonna talk on the Bonus Show

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.460
about Obama's Clean Water Proposal
-[David] Yeah.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.180
- Which at a federal level would help address

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:44.220
what's going on over there.

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:46.100
- You might wonder how they even pass

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.580
such a ridiculous bill.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.560
This might not shock you.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.080
They attached it to an animal rights bill

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.140
which was trying to keep pets out of the hands

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:54.160
of animal abusers,

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.360
and they put in a section about beastiality

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.580
and then they said two adults having anal sex

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.720
is basically like abusing an animal.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.920
And the language specifically is:

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.200
a person who commits the abominable

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.480
and detestable crime against nature, sodomy,

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:12.700
either with mankind, or with any animal,

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.160
is guilty of a felony, punishable by imprisonment

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.920
for not more than 15 years.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:21.100
Politics at its worst.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:24.860
What is more abominable and detestable,

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.160
anal sex between consenting adults,

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.400
or subjecting an entire community

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.760
to toxic water to save a few bucks?

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:33.780
You decide, Louis.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.620
I'm glad they have their priorities straight.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.080
- Oh, also ten children died as a result of that.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.060
-[David] Right.
- Yeah.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.520
- Ban anal, Louis, ten children died from water.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.940
- Yes. So I think

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:46.180
we don't really need to comment any more on that.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.300
I think we know

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:49.460
Which one is more detestable.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.260
- Yeah. Basically speaks for itself.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.520
Absolutely disgusting.

